<title>UK: John Lewis UK store sales up 6.0% in week.</title>
<headline>John Lewis UK store sales up 6.0% in week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The John Lewis Partnership said its UK department store sales rose 6.0 percent in the week to December 7 compared with the same week a year earlier.</p>
<p>In the 19 weeks to December 7, sales were up 12.9 percent year-on-year.</p>
<p>Total sales, including the Waitrose supermarket chain, rose 5.6 percent in the week and were up 11.0 percent in the 19-week period.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
